OL,5,G2000 How the Nazis Lost the War
OL,6,     FGermany had few allies before
OL,7,     FWWII, and, for various reasons,
OL,8,     Fthose alliances were doomed to
OL,9,     Ffail. Ultimately, Germany paid a
OL,10,     Fheavy price for the partnerships
OL,11,     Fthey forged with the Axis Powers.
